
Proportional colocalization test
-----------------------------------
          Method  eta p_coloc
 prop-coloc-cond   NA      NA
 prop-coloc-full 0.06    0.00
-----------------------------------

p_coloc assesses proportional colocalization hypothesis (rejection indicates failure to colocalize).
Proportional colocalization is suggested when the proportional colocalization hypothesis is not rejected.
LM test does not reject evidence for a non-zero proportionality constant at significance level  0.05
Only prop-coloc-full results are presented. Please interpret output with caution.
